s://imgur.com/a/3ShnkyU", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@k20_draw/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/02f0feb5/uploads/origins/e1815d89-9a73-43a1-868d-4fe3447a614f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f0e508eef90be022cfdc06f4696426f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/02f0feb5/uploads/origins/e1815d89-9a73-43a1-868d-4fe3447a614f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f0e508eef90be022cfdc06f4696426f, https://si.imgix.net/02f0feb5/uploads/origins/e1815d89-9a73-43a1-868d-4fe3447a614f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=026c472714f044bad7031340004238b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/02f0feb5/uploads/origins/e1815d89-9a73-43a1-868d-4fe3447a614f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ace5b4ddbf8ff76ba64e7444e446deaa 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hey hey! \nYour art looks super pretty!! and i would love to commission you!\n\nI'd like to request an illustration of my official character named Sakura in her summer dress outfit! I'd like her to be wearing a flower crown and holding a bouquet! \n\nFor her expression I'd like her to be happy and smiling. and for her pose I'll leave that up to you! \n\nAlso please don’t forget her glasses and the flowers decorations in her hair and tail!\n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-N5tAmpUWqyXOcdkQqgqutRq1bnBaTPb", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@k20_draw/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6989d082/uploads/origins/c63a7b5a-0200-451e-b671-5d7c813ad850?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92b9a03c322494d2fa27392e09e7d70d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6989d082/uploads/origins/c63a7b5a-0200-451e-b671-5d7c813ad850?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92b9a03c322494d2fa27392e09e